flowchart TD
    L[100-level catalog] --> V[Static validator]
    L --> P[Pure puzzle engine]
    P --> R[React runtime adapter]
    P --> H[Free hint selector]
    P --> F[Monotonic exit closure]
    P --> D[Stateful lexicographic search]
    F --> S[Hybrid solver result]
    D --> S
    S --> A[Difficulty analyzer]
    A --> Q[Five-phase quality gate]
    M[Manifests + blueprints + seeds] --> G[Phase-specific generators]
    G --> V
    Q -->|accept| L
    Q -->|reject| G
